Description: Fast, native Rust AI agent skills & stacks workbench
 UnoSkills manages AI agent skills (SKILL.md) across 22 supported agents
 from a local-first central library, with declarative stacks, marketplace
 discovery, and a GPUI desktop workbench. Includes both the desktop app
 (unoskills-app) and the CLI (unoskills).
